  "description": "Signing-key revocation signing bytes (avalon_protocol::identity_id::signing_key_revoked_signing_bytes_v2): UTF-8 of 'avalon:identity.signing_key_revoked:v2:{identity_id}:{signing_key_id}:{revoked_by_signing_key_id}'. The signature is Ed25519 by the revoking (already-active) key over the bytes. Key ids are UUID text (lowercase hyphenated), so no ':' can appear in them and swapping the two ids changes the bytes.",
